@page
@model Praja.Web.Pages.SubmitModel
@{ViewData["Title"]="Submit a complaint";}
<p><a class="button secondary" href="/offline.html">Offline capture / ಸಂಪರ್ಕವಿಲ್ಲದೆ ದೂರು ಉಳಿಸಿ</a> Text-only offline capture. Photos and device location need the online form. Open once while connected to prepare this device.</p>
<div><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CITIZEN PORTAL</span><h1>Tell us what needs fixing.</h1><p>Describe the issue in English or Kannada. We suggest the service; officers handle the work.</p></div></div><p><a href="/CitizenLogin">Track my complaint / Citizen access</a> · <a href="/Transparency">Public progress dashboard</a> · <a href="/PublicMap">Nearby complaints</a></p>
@if(Model.Submitted is {} item){
<section class="panel form-panel" role="status"><h2>Complaint received</h2><p>Your reference: <strong>@item.Reference</strong></p><p>Service: @CaseRules.Departments[item.Department]. Awaiting intake review and officer assignment.</p><label for="receipt-code">Save your private tracking code</label><textarea id="receipt-code" readonly rows="4" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">@Model.Code</textarea><p>Valid for seven days. Anyone holding this code can view progress and shared evidence and confirm or dispute resolution. Keep it private.</p><a class="button primary" href="/Track">Open citizen tracking</a></section>
}else{
<section class="panel form-panel"><form method="post" id="intake-form" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-busy><div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation" role="alert"></div><input asp-for="SubmissionKey" type="hidden"/><label asp-for="Language">Language / ಭಾಷೆ</label><select asp-for="Language"><option>English</option><option>Kannada</option></select><input type="hidden" asp-for="Source" id="Input_Source"/>
<section id="citizen-help"><h2>1. Tell us your problem / ನಿಮ್ಮ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಹೇಳಿ</h2><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="listen-guide">Listen to instructions / ಸೂಚನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ</button><p id="citizen-help-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
<section id="voice-intake" data-citizen="true" data-speech-configured="@Model.SpeechConfigured.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"><h3>Speak instead of typing / ಮಾತನಾಡಿ</h3><p>Record up to two minutes. Mention the place, problem and help needed. You can listen before sending.</p><button type="button" class="button primary" id="record-start">Record voice / ಧ್ವನಿ ದಾಖಲಿಸಿ</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="record-stop" disabled>Stop recording / ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಿ</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="record-clear" disabled>Clear recording</button><p id="record-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">Microphone starts only when you choose Record voice.</p><audio id="record-preview" controls hidden></audio><label for="Audio">Or choose a recording (WAV, MP3, WebM or Ogg; up to 8 MB)</label><input type="file" id="Audio" name="Audio" accept=".wav,.mp3,.webm,.ogg"/><label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" id="Input_Consent" name="VoiceConsent" value="true"/><span>I agree to send this recording to the configured OpenAI speech service to turn it into text. Praja does not retain the audio with the complaint.</span></label><button type="submit" formnovalidate formaction="/CitizenVoice?handler=Audio" id="transcribe-audio" class="button secondary">Turn voice into text / ಬರಹಕ್ಕೆ ಬದಲಿಸಿ</button><p id="media-intake-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>@if(!Model.SpeechConfigured){<p>Speech transcription is unavailable until the workspace administrator configures it. You can still type or ask a trusted person to help.</p>}</section>
<h2>2. Check your words / ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ</h2><label asp-for="Original" for="Input_OriginalText">What happened? / ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಏನು?</label><textarea asp-for="Original" id="Input_OriginalText" required minlength="20" maxlength="6000" rows="7" placeholder="Describe the problem, when it started and the help needed."></textarea><p>Do not include passwords, identity numbers or unrelated personal details.</p><div class="dashboard-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="listen-complaint">Listen to my complaint / ದೂರು ಕೇಳಿ</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="stop-reading">Stop reading</button></div><p>Read-aloud needs an installed English or Kannada browser voice. Ask a trusted person to check any words that sound wrong.</p><h2>3. Where is the problem? / ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಎಲ್ಲಿದೆ?</h2>
<section id="citizen-location" aria-labelledby="citizen-location-heading">
<h3 id="citizen-location-heading">Add the incident location (optional) / ಘಟನೆಯ ಸ್ಥಳ</h3>
<p id="citizen-location-help">If you are at the incident, capture this device’s current location. Your browser asks for permission. Use the problem’s location, not your home or another place. Coordinates are shared with the officers handling this complaint; they do not prove where a photo was taken.</p>
<div class="dashboard-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="citizen-location-capture" aria-describedby="citizen-location-help">Use my current location / ನನ್ನ ಪ್ರಸ್ತುತ ಸ್ಥಳ</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="citizen-location-clear">Clear coordinates / ಸ್ಥಳ ತೆರವುಗೊಳಿಸಿ</button></div>
<p id="citizen-location-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">No location requested. You can submit using the district and locality below.</p>
<details id="citizen-location-coordinates"><summary>Check or enter coordinates / ಸ್ಥಳ ನಿರ್ದೇಶಾಂಕಗಳು</summary>
<label asp-for="Latitude" for="citizen-latitude">Incident latitude (−90 to 90)</label><input asp-for="Latitude" id="citizen-latitude" type="number" min="-90" max="90" step="any" inputmode="decimal"/>
<label asp-for="Longitude" for="citizen-longitude">Incident longitude (−180 to 180)</label><input asp-for="Longitude" id="citizen-longitude" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="any" inputmode="decimal"/>
<p>Enter both coordinates or leave both blank. Changing coordinates removes the device accuracy estimate.</p></details>
<input asp-for="Accuracy" id="citizen-location-accuracy" type="hidden"/>
</section>
<label asp-for="District">District / ಜಿಲ್ಲೆ</label><input asp-for="District" required minlength="2" maxlength="100"/><label asp-for="Location">Ward, locality or village / ಸ್ಥಳ</label><input asp-for="Location" required minlength="2" maxlength="200"/><section aria-labelledby="incident-photo-heading"><h2 id="incident-photo-heading">4. Add a photo (optional) / ಫೋಟೋ ಸೇರಿಸಿ</h2>
<p id="incident-photo-help">Take or choose one clear photo of the problem. JPEG or PNG, up to 8 MB. Avoid identity documents, faces and unrelated personal details. The photo stays with this complaint for authorised officers and your private tracking view; it is not sent for AI analysis.</p>
<label asp-for="Photo">Incident photo / ಘಟನೆಯ ಫೋಟೋ</label><input asp-for="Photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png" capture="environment" aria-describedby="incident-photo-help"/>
<label class="check-row"><input asp-for="PhotoConsent"/><span>I agree to this photo being stored with my complaint and shared with the authorised team handling it.</span></label>
<p>If submission has an error, choose the photo again before retrying. You can submit without a photo.</p></section>
<label class="check-row"><input asp-for="Consent" required/><span>I agree to this complaint being stored and shared with the officers handling it.</span></label><label class="check-row"><input asp-for="PublicMapConsent"/><span>Show this complaint’s service, reference, dates and progress on the public map at an approximate location (rounded to about 1 km). This is optional and needs incident coordinates. My text, name and photos stay private. I can remove it through my private tracking page.</span></label><label class="check-row"><input asp-for="Sample"/><span>This is a fictional test complaint. Exclude it from public performance totals.</span></label><p>This prototype records complaints locally. It does not submit to a government portal. Typed complaint categorisation uses local rules. Audio is sent to the speech service only when you agree and select Turn voice into text.</p><button class="button primary" id="prepare-draft">Submit complaint / ದೂರು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿ</button></form></section>
}</div>

